'''Ribbons''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 7th tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Ribbons uses the same mesh as the [[Default Knife]], but appears to be wrapped up in ribbons along the blade and the handle. The ribbons vary in colors from red, green, blue, and magenta. 

